---
---
<section class="py-20 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden glass-panel border border-neon/40 p-10 sm:p-16 text-center shadow-neon-lg">
      <div class="absolute -top-24 -left-24 w-96 h-96 bg-neon/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 bg-indigo-600/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-surface-elevated border-2 border-neon flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-3xl shadow-neon">
          🐱
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
          ¿Listo para Poner a Trabajar a tu <span class="text-neon">Agente Felino</span>?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg">
          Activa tu primer agente de facturación o agenda una llamada con nuestro equipo técnico para diseñar tu solución privada dedicada.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 pt-4">
          <a href="/contacto" class="btn-primary px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl text-base font-title font-bold shadow-neon">
            <span>Iniciar Demo en WhatsApp</span>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M2.01 21L23 12 2.01 3 2 10l15 2-15 2z"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="/agentes" class="btn-secondary px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl text-base font-title font-bold">
            <span>Explorar Roles y Precios</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
